{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06771","headline":"观江淮名胜图 · 王昌龄","name":"观江淮名胜图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"刻意吟云山，尤知隐沦妙。\n远公何爲者，再诣临海峤。\n而我高其风，披图得遗照。\n援毫无逃境，遂展千里眺。\n淡扫荆门烟，明标赤城烧。\n青葱林间岭，隐见淮海徼。\n但指香炉顶，无闻白猿啸。\n沙门既云灭，独往岂殊调。\n感对怀拂衣，胡宁事渔钓。\n安期始遗舃，千古谢荣耀。\n投迹庶可齐，沧浪有孤棹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06771.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06771","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}